  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>e</mi></math> denote the base of the natural logarithm. The value of the real number <math><mi>a</mi></math> for which the right-hand limit <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#967;</mi></mfrac></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></msup></mfrac></math> is equal to a non-zero real number, is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msup><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msup><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Which is real number if and only if&nbsp;<math><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math></p>"
